; Deny user namespace creation for the blastwall automation domain.
; User namespaces are the first step in 44% of observed kernel exploit
; chains (Google research).  CVE-2025-38617 uses userns to obtain
; CAP_NET_RAW unprivileged.  Automation identities should never create
; user namespaces.
;
; Wrapped in an optional block so OpenShift/container runtimes that make the
; user namespace class unreachable through seccomp or kernel configuration can
; report explicit absent evidence instead of pretending to have SELinux proof.

(optional blastwall_userns_deny
  (deny blastwall_t self (user_namespace (create)))
  (neverallow blastwall_t self (user_namespace (create))))
